"PROGRAM Main;\n    INPUT:  DataStream, Config;\n    OUTPUT: ReportStream;\n    \\ Local Variables\n    \n    // Define Data Types\n    \n    // Input data structure\n    \n    // Process pipeline\n    Data <- Ingest(Stream);\n    ValidData <- Validate(Data);\n    TransformedData <- Transform(ValidData);\n    Report <- GenerateReport(TransformedData);\n    Output(Report);\n    \nEND Main"
